## Conditional Structures

Conditional structures check if a condition is met, and if it is true an specific code will be executed.

```{r}
x <- 3
if (x > 2) { 
  print("x is greater than 2")
}
```

This structures can have an alternative option to execute.

```{r}
x <- 2
if (x > 2) { 
  print("x is greater than 2")
} else {
  print("x is less or equal to 2")
}
```

And you can manage multiple conditions to check.

```{r}
x <- 2
if (x > 2) { 
  print("x is greater than 2")
} else if (x == 2) {
  print("x is equal to 2")
} else {
  print("x is less than 2")
}
```

